{"id":"632574","name":"泰式菠萝饭","author":"森林小花熊_lZQJ","authorId":"10793829","desc":"","cover":"images/632574/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"500g"},{"name":"菠萝","amount":"分之一"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"青豆","amount":"30g"},{"name":"胡萝卜碎","amount":"1根"},{"name":"瑶柱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲜虾仁。","img":"images/632574/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜碎。","img":"images/632574/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青豆煮一下待用。","img":"images/632574/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"菠萝块。","img":"images/632574/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋米饭。","img":"images/632574/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蛋黄和蛋清分开，蛋黄放米饭上。","img":"images/632574/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蛋黄拌米饭。","img":"images/632574/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"瑶柱。","img":"images/632574/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把瑶柱炸一下。","img":"images/632574/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"金黄色后出锅。","img":"images/632574/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"单炒蛋清后待用。","img":"images/632574/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"炒虾仁。","img":"images/632574/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"虾仁熟后下青豆和胡萝卜碎继续炒。","img":"images/632574/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"一起炒的样子。","img":"images/632574/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入米饭一起炒。","img":"images/632574/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"下粉和蚝油水，1勺蚝油配大约30到50克水化开加入。","img":"images/632574/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"加入菠萝。","img":"images/632574/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"最后把瑶柱加入翻炒。","img":"images/632574/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"翻炒好。","img":"images/632574/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/632574/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"最好用长粒米，米饭蒸硬一点。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}